{"ref":"BDB, נָקֹד","hw":"נָקֹד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָקֹד</span></big>  <strong>adj.</strong> speckled;—only of sheep and goats; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֻדּוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">טָלוּא</span>), mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֻדִּים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:39\" href=\"/Genesis.30.39\">39</a> (‖ <em>id.</em> + <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲקֻדִּים</span>;—all these J); mpl. also <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:8\" href=\"/Genesis.31.8\">31:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> and (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲקֻדִּים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרֻדִּים</span>) v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:10\" href=\"/Genesis.31.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:12\" href=\"/Genesis.31.12\">12</a> (all E).","next":"BDB, נִקּוּד","prev":"BDB, נקד"}